5. Authentication
The application provides registration, login, and logout functions. Registration requires a name, email, and password of at least eight characters. The application hashes passwords with bcryptjs before storing them. Login verifies the supplied password against the stored hash. After successful authentication, the application creates a signed session cookie. The dashboard checks this session and redirects unauthenticated users to the login page.
